<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 586-7 AT TEA ON 2ND DAY VS SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 586-7 AT TEA ON 2ND DAY VS SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 586 for the loss of seven wickets at tea on the second day of the first test against Sri Lanka on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 586 for seven (B. Young 267 not out, M. Horne 66, S. Fleming 51, C.Cairns 70).</p>
